Subject: [EXPERIMENT] ASoC: q6apm: keep FullIO backends transport-only

Permit the matching Denali companion DAIs to prepare SoundWire without
creating, configuring, starting or closing a separate DSP graph.
The topology gate remains closed while the frontend calibration is unfinished.

diff --git a/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6apm-lpass-dais.c b/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6apm-lpass-dais.c
